23. Find Customers Who Purchased Every Month

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import countDistinct

months = 12

df.groupBy("customer_id") \
  .agg(countDistinct("month").alias("cnt")) \
  .filter(f"cnt={months}")

SQL:

SELECT customer_id
FROM sales
GROUP BY customer_id
HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT month)=12;
